gressive-releases-jp","text":"「実戦で変更されない計画はない。」これはプロイセンの陸軍元帥ヘルムート・フォン・モルトケが残したとされる有名な言葉です。この言葉はソフトウェア開発にも当てはまります。「実用で変更されないコードはない」 ミッションクリティカルな環境で運用中のアプリケーションやサービスの安定性を最大限に確保するには、段階…","image_url":"https://ubuntu.com/wp-content/uploads/77f5/andrew-ruiz-YXSJ33Pbg7g-unsplash-smaller.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"Ubuntu Japan","service_icon":"https://res.cloudinary.com/canonical/image/fetch/q_auto,f_auto/https://assets.ubuntu.com/v1/17b68252-apple-touch-icon-180x180-precomposed-ubuntu.png","from_url":"https://jp.ubuntu.com/blog/experimental-feature-progressive-releases-jp","original_url":"https://jp.ubuntu.com/blog/experimental-feature-progressive-releases-jp"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=Ov"}]},{"client_msg_id":"606c7b06-2f5d-436a-926d-83ac6288d0ab","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"(直感的には単にupdateをqueueingしてるだけに見えるけど、実はたぶん内部でいろいろやっていると推測してます)","ts":"1628965037.137500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"z=KP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4a9b07eb-1d8e-478f-a2bf-0bdc364d6016","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"一般にubuntuとかにある例のrolling updateのメリットって何なのかちょっと気になる","ts":"1628965017.136900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/er"}]}]
